WEBVTT

00:00:59.246 --> 00:01:01.746
the heck comes next. Where to begin.

00:01:02.121 --> 00:01:03.996
I wish I could just be patient

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:08.579
and I wish I would just fast forward to
where my business is established.

00:01:08.746 --> 00:01:12.329
I wish I could figure out what that
next direction should be.

00:01:16.413 --> 00:01:20.246
Is Zig-Zag the business podcast
about being human?

00:01:21.038 --> 00:01:25.288
I'm a new semrad, and this new season
is something I'm calling

00:01:25.288 --> 00:01:31.621
the Zig-Zag Project six episodes to
get you from stuck to inspired.